f="1471-2156-6-S1-S86-1"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F2"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p><bold>LOD scores obtained using MIBDs uncorrected and corrected for LD</bold>. These are plots of the maximum LOD score region of chromosomes 3 and 18 of the COGA ttdt3 trait. LOD scores were calculated using MIBDs constructed by removing SNP pairs that in founders showed LD as <italic>r</italic><sup>2 </sup>&#x02265; {0.2, 0.4, 0.6}. LOD scores calculated using uncorrected MIBDs are also shown.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2156-6-S1-S86-2"/></fig></sec></back></article>